---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import peony from '../pages/assets/images/hero-rose.jpg.jpg';
---

<section class="section story" id="story" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div class="story-inner page">
    <div class="story-photo">
      <Image src={peony} alt="Pink peony candle on a white marble tray beside a gold wick trimmer" widths={[480, 720, 960]} sizes="(max-width: 860px) 100vw, 45vw" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 id="story-title">made with care,<br /><em>and a little curiosity.</em></h2>
      <p>Little Glow began with a love for chemistry and beautiful little things. Each candle brings together curiosity, creativity, and careful craftsmanship, thoughtfully hand-poured in small batches.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
